1.0.5 (2026-11-03)
------------------
- Add GetReservationFiles (get_reservation_files) and GetReservationFilesXml
  (get_reservation_files_xml) on ReservationService. Both take optional sort and
  filter specs and return reservation file attachments (ReservationID,
  ReservationNumber, FileName, Created, Comment, FileUrl, Tag, Source). These
  operations were newly added to the live LegaOnline rental WSDL.
- Re-verified live WSDL operation coverage: all rental and financial operations
  are now covered by the client.

1.0.4 (2026-10-09)
------------------
- Remove GetInvoiceV7Xml (get_invoice_v7_xml): the operation does not exist in
  the live LegaOnline WSDL (only GetInvoiceV7 and GetInvoiceV8 exist, without
  Xml variants), so calling it raised a "SOAP method not found" error.
- Verified all 227 live WSDL operations are covered by the client.

1.0.2 (2026-06-08)
------------------
- Fix: patch LegaOnline WSDL at load time to declare missing xmlns:s namespace.
  LegaOnline's WSDL uses s:string/s:int/s:boolean but omits xmlns:s declaration,
  causing zeep to raise XMLParseError. The fix injects
  xmlns:s="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema" on the root definitions element.
